{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/27405","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/27405/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/27405/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/issues/27405/events","html_url":"https://github.com/symfony/symfony/issues/27405","id":327285456,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMjcyODU0NTY=","number":27405,"title":"TagAwareAdapter over nonbinary memcached connections corrupts memcache.","user":{"login":"palex-fpt","id":1787780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODc3ODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1787780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt","html_url":"https://github.com/palex-fpt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/palex-fpt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":100079,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAwNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null},{"id":237003792,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzcwMDM3OTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Review","name":"Status: Needs Review","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":313658463,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTM2NTg0NjM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symfony/symfony/labels/Cache","name":"Cache","color":"dddddd","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2018-05-29T11:47:41Z","updated_at":"2018-06-08T22:46:09Z","closed_at":"2018-06-08T22:46:09Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Symfony version(s) affected**: 4.0.0\r\n\r\n\r\n**Description**  \r\nTagAwareAdapter over nonbinary memcached connections corrupts memcache.\r\n\r\n**How to reproduce**  \r\n```\r\n\tpublic function testTagAwareAdapterOverMemcached()\r\n\t{\r\n\t\t$nonbinaryMemcached = new \\Memcached();\r\n\t\t$nonbinaryMemcached->addServer('memcached', 11211);\r\n\t\t$nonbinaryMemcached->setOption(\\Memcached::OPT_BINARY_PROTOCOL, false);\r\n\t\t$simpleCache = new MemcachedAdapter($nonbinaryMemcached);\r\n\t\t$tagAwareCache = new TagAwareAdapter($simpleCache);\r\n\r\n\t\t$simpleCache->save($simpleCache->getItem(\"simple\")->set(1));\r\n\r\n\t\t// TagAwareAdapter corrupts nonbinary memcached\r\n\t\t$tagAwareCache->save($tagAwareCache->getItem(\"tagged\")->set(1));\r\n\r\n\t\t$this->assertEquals(1, $simpleCache->getItem(\"simple\")->get());\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Possible Solution**  \r\nTagAwareAdapter uses '\\0' in key names, that are incompatible with memcached in normal mode. Possible solution is to change key prefix.","closed_by":{"login":"nicolas-grekas","id":243674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzY3NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/243674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-grekas","html_url":"https://github.com/nicolas-grekas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-grekas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-greka